Protein name: Human cytochrome C
Organism: Homo sapiens
PDB ID: 3ZCF
Experimental method (X-ray, Cryo-EM, NMR, etc.): X-ray diffraction
Resolution (if available): 1.65 Å
Biological significance: Plays a role in electron transfer chain in inner mitochondrial membrane, as well as the mitochondrial apoptosis pathway.

